            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why do we create variables for the element we want to remove and its parent?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To make the code more readable</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To access the elements</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To make the code more readable.</p></body></html>"
