ent\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".getElementById(\" /><text value=\"&quot;enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hud.removeChild(\" /><text value=\"&quot;enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It calls <code>hud.removeChild()</code> with an ID value, instead of an element</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It calls <code>hud.removeChild()</code> with the wrong ID</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It calls <code>hud.removeChild()</code> with an ID value, instead of an element.</p></body></html>"
